+ * -------------------------------------
+ * The previous sitemap listed `/` plus five FRAGMENT urls — /#features,
+ * /#how-it-works, /#roi, /#pricing, /#waitlist. A fragment is not a distinct
+ * URL: search engines normalise it away, so a six-entry sitemap declared
